example:
远程库存的三个阶段。支付等待不在 `reserve` 这个全局事务里：

```java
public interface StockTcc {
  @TwoPhaseBusinessAction(name = "stockTcc", commitMethod = "confirm", rollbackMethod = "cancel")
  boolean tryReserve(BusinessActionContext ctx,
      @BusinessActionContextParameter(paramName = "orderId") String orderId,
      @BusinessActionContextParameter(paramName = "qty") int qty);

  boolean confirm(BusinessActionContext ctx);

  boolean cancel(BusinessActionContext ctx);
}
```

```java
@GlobalTransactional
public void reserveOnly(String orderId, int qty) {
  stockTcc.tryReserve(null, orderId, qty);
}
```

`reserveOnly` 返回就结束全局事务。用户去支付。超时后另一次调用走 `cancel`，不把支付页面放进 `reserveOnly`。
